				{
					"id": 752470460,
					"content": "咔库库哥们，先生，实不相瞒，我有个不情之请。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470461
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470461,
					"content": "听说握住手就可以沾上对方的好运，我们能不能…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470462
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470462,
					"content": "哈哈！没问题，哥们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470463,
						752470466
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔库库"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470463,
					"content": "在欧洛伦的带领下，大家纷纷握住了咔库库的翅膀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470464
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470464,
					"content": "因为手感太好，事情逐渐演变成了抚摸咔库库的头。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470465
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470465,
					"content": "圆圆的，软软的，名不虚传，令你流连忘返。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 752470466,
					"content": "天哪，真是摸了个够，感觉今年剩下的日子都会走运的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470467
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470467,
					"content": "一定会的。因为派蒙有非常好的伙伴，就像咔库库一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470468
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470468,
					"content": "看、看我干嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470469
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470469,
					"content": "你的计划已经圆满达成，也该跟大家说实话了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470470
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470470,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470471
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470471,
					"content": "欸、欸？什么意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470472,
						752470473
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470472,
					"content": "难道说咔库库的好运…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470474
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470474,
					"content": "好啦，好啦，也没什么关系吧。能有我这样的哥们，的确是咔库库的好运之一啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470475
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470475,
					"content": "不要诡辩，你老实交代。从一开始的钓鱼起，就都是你安排的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470476
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470476,
					"content": "…嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470477
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470477,
					"content": "那位蒙德冒险家，你之前就认识？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470478
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470478,
					"content": "没有，也就比你早认识了一天吧。只是提前拜托他，让他帮忙指个路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470479
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470479,
					"content": "麻烦豚兽和阿夏拿出画片，陪咔库库一路游玩，还有那些「闪闪礼蛋」，都是我提前准备的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470480
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470480,
					"content": "哦天哪，哥们…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470481
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔库库"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470481,
					"content": "哈哈…就是人果然没法完全让动物理解自己的意思，结果被豚兽大王误会了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470482
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470482,
					"content": "我猜它可能以为我带了其他人来抢回本来给咔库库准备的东西，所以才心情不好的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470483
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470483,
					"content": "原来它真的叫「豚兽大王」啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470484
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470484,
					"content": "当然不，我只是在顺着你说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470485
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470485,
					"content": "天哪哥们，我感动了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470486
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470486,
					"content": "…哎呀总之就是这样啦！最近正好要到咔库库和我们认识的纪念日了，我就想着要给它准备点小礼物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470487
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470487,
					"content": "因为不知道咔库库的生日究竟是哪天，所以我们一直把这当成咔库库的生日庆祝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470488
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470488,
					"content": "咔库库虽然一直装作一副和大伙称兄道弟的成熟样子，但本身还只是一条贪玩的小龙嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470489
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470489,
					"content": "那小龙就该有小龙的样子，给我尽情地玩，懂吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470490
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470490,
					"content": "哥们，哥们…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470491
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔库库"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470491,
					"content": "哦？咔库库有话要说？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470492
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470492,
					"content": "哥们，不是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470493
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔库库"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470493,
					"content": "嗯嗯，我懂的，你不用说了，我们都爱你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470494
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470494,
					"content": "是啊是啊，不用不好意思。在度假村的这些天，就请你像任何一只自由的绒翼龙一样，好好玩耍吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470495
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470495,
					"content": "纪念日快乐，咔库库！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470496
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470496,
					"content": "哥们，哥们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "咔库库"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470473,
					"content": "都是哥们你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470474
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470440,
					"content": "请咔库库压轴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470441
					]
				}
			]
		},
